[00:07.20]1. How can we endure
[00:14.40]When trials come, as Jesus said?
[00:20.25]Through his pain he saw
[00:24.38]The joy of better things ahead.
[00:29.56]God’s promise, God’s justice,
[00:34.52]Were thoughts on which he fed.
[00:36.96](Chorus)
[00:39.40]We need to have endurance.
[00:44.40]Our faith we must defend.
[00:49.40]His love is our assurance.
[00:54.24]So we will keep enduring to the end.
[01:00.63]2. Though the passing years
[01:07.01]May bring us sorrow, bring us pain;
[01:13.39]There beyond the tears,
[01:19.77]We see the life that we can gain.
[01:28.89]To be there, feel free there,
[01:33.98]Determined we remain.
[01:36.42](Chorus)
[01:38.86]We need to have endurance.
[01:43.86]Our faith we must defend.
[01:49.00]His love is our assurance.
[01:53.56]So we will keep enduring to the end.
[02:08.35]3. We will not give up
[02:23.13]Nor see the need for doubt or fear.
[02:28.99]Faithfully we’ll serve
[02:33.60]Until Jehovah’s day is here.
[02:38.21]Let’s keep on enduring.
[02:43.20]That time is very near.
[02:45.55](Chorus)
[02:47.90]We need to have endurance.
[02:52.90]Our faith we must defend.
[02:57.90]His love is our assurance.
[03:02.90]So we will keep enduring to the end.